OL,4,BDrivers limited to 27 laps for tyres   
OL,5,Bin Qatar                               
OL,6,GFormula 1 drivers will be limited to a 
OL,7,Gmaximum of 27 laps on a set of tyres   
OL,8,Gat next weekend's Qatar Grand Prix.    
OL,10,FThe decision is caused by concern over 
OL,11,Fthe integrity of the Pirelli tyres on  
OL,12,Fthe high-speed Lusail track, which has 
OL,13,Fa series of demanding, long-duration   
OL,14,Fcorners.                               
OL,16,FIt means teams will have to make at    
OL,17,Fleast two pit stops during the 57-lap  
OL,18,Fgrand prix, as was the case last year. 
OL,20,FThe limit applies on a single set of   
OL,21,Ftyres whenever it is used across       
OL,22,Fsessions.                              
